                        <p class="text-muted">Immediate treatment for breathing difficulties, severe asthma attacks, pneumonia, COPD exacerbation, and TB-related emergencies.</p>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled text-start">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Expert care by Dr. Md. Khalilur Rahman</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>30+ years experience</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Oxygen therapy & Ventilator support</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Emergency chest X-Ray available</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
