                        <p class="text-muted">24/7 emergency care for pregnancy complications, delivery emergencies, severe menstrual bleeding, and gynecological surgeries.</p>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled text-start">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Led by Dr. Farjana Mahjabin (Ovi)</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>20+ years surgical experience</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Emergency delivery services</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Laparoscopic emergency surgery</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card card-hover h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
                        <div class="icon-container bg-primary bg-opacity-10 mx-auto mb-4">
                            <i class="fas fa-procedures text-primary fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">Surgical Emergency</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">Emergency surgical interventions for acute abdominal pain, injuries, fractures, appendicitis, and laparoscopic emergencies.</p>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled text-start">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Expert care by Dr. Shamima Khatun Poly</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>FCPS qualified surgeon</li>
